---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="送信完了" noindex>
<section class="min-h-screen bg-gray-950 text-white flex items-center justify-center px-6">
  <div class="text-center max-w-lg">
    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-8">
      <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Thank You</p>
    <h1 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-black mb-4">エントリーを受け付けました。</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-10">
      ご応募ありがとうございます。<br />
      3営業日以内に担当者よりご連絡いたします。<br />
      しばらくお待ちください。
    </p>
    <div class="text-left bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">ご連絡までの間に</p>
      <a href="https://lin.ee/Z7jiZg1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-green-400/40 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-green-500/10 transition-colors">
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">LINEを追加しておくと、連絡がスムーズです</span>
        <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold text-green-300">追加 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/mensetsu-nani-wo-kikareru" class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 px-4 py-3 hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
        <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">ブログ：面接で聞かれること</span>
        <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-bold text-blue-300">読む →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white font-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all duration-300">
      トップページへ戻る
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
